-- Block rating converts 2:1 with Crit (level60-stat-curve HANDOFF 1.10, user ruling 2026-11-20, PROPOSAL round 13):
-- CR_BLOCK (CR 4) rows 400-499 x 7/5 at every level, so level 60 reads 7 rating per 1% block (was 5). Block now
-- rides the secondary item curve (item_stat_cost.budget_curve 1), so it grows like Crit; the steeper conversion keeps
-- ilvl 60 gear at today's block chance. Each UPDATE guards on the old value (float tolerance, the column is FLOAT), so
-- a re-run or a hand-edited row is a no-op. Regenerate patch-Y at deploy (apps/dbc-tools/patch_gt_tables.py covers
-- CR 4 through lib/gt_dbc.py's RETUNED_COMBAT_RATINGS).
